WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.202
Roxy flew into the air.

2
00:00:14.203 --> 00:00:16.176
Now she had a plan.

3
00:00:16.177 --> 00:00:19.386
"I'll follow that armored truck," she thought.

4
00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:22.604
"Stinky Bart will definitely try to rob it."

5
00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:25.690
Roxy followed the armored truck.

6
00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:29.271
The truck turned off West Street.

7
00:00:29.272 --> 00:00:33.074
It stopped at a grocery store.

8
00:00:33.075 --> 00:00:37.903
The guards put some money into the truck.

9
00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:41.238
The truck drove some more.

10
00:00:41.239 --> 00:00:45.703
It stopped at two more stores and one bank.

11
00:00:45.704 --> 00:00:51.666
Then it got stuck in a traffic jam.

12
00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:55.885
After two more turns, the truck was back on West Street.

13
00:00:55.886 --> 00:00:59.138
Roxy didn't see Stinky Bart anywhere.

14
00:00:59.139 --> 00:01:03.798
Roxy sighed. "This was a dumb idea. I should—"

15
00:01:03.799 --> 00:01:07.779
"Yee-ha!" shouted a voice.

16
00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:10.439
"Stinky Bart!" thought Roxy.

17
00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:14.018
A man on a horse was chasing the armored truck.

18
00:01:14.019 --> 00:01:17.634
He wore cowboy boots and a floppy cowboy hat.

19
00:01:17.635 --> 00:01:20.502
He was swinging a lasso over his head.

20
00:01:20.503 --> 00:01:24.199
"I want that money!" shouted Stinky Bart.

21
00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:27.202
He threw the lasso toward the armored truck.

22
00:01:27.203 --> 00:01:29.773
"Uh-oh!" cried Roxy.

23
00:01:29.774 --> 00:01:33.355
She fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

24
00:01:33.356 --> 00:01:37.180
Ping! The laser beams bounced off the lasso.

25
00:01:37.181 --> 00:01:39.612
The lasso missed the truck.

26
00:01:39.613 --> 00:01:41.856
"Wow," said Roxy.

27
00:01:41.857 --> 00:01:46.647
"My eye laser beams didn't harm that lasso at all!

28
00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:49.377
But at least I saved the truck."

29
00:01:49.378 --> 00:01:52.994
Stinky Bart jumped off the horse and glared at Roxy.

30
00:01:52.995 --> 00:01:57.707
"That sure made me angry, Rocket Girl," said the cowboy.

31
00:01:57.708 --> 00:02:00.300
He started swinging the lasso.

32
00:02:00.301 --> 00:02:04.582
"Yep! I'm mighty angry right now!"

33
00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:09.003
Shwoosh! The lasso sailed toward Roxy.

34
00:02:09.004 --> 00:02:11.054
She darted out of the way.

35
00:02:11.055 --> 00:02:14.498
"Missed me!" Roxy laughed.

36
00:02:14.499 --> 00:02:17.707
"Hoo, boy!" said Stinky Bart.

37
00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:23.406
"I am furious!" He threw the lasso again.

38
00:02:23.407 --> 00:02:26.774
Roxy laughed as she moved out of the way again.

39
00:02:26.775 --> 00:02:30.538
"You'll never catch me, Stinky Bart!"

40
00:02:30.539 --> 00:02:33.341
Stinky Bart stopped swinging the lasso.

41
00:02:33.342 --> 00:02:35.985
"Maybe not," he said.

42
00:02:35.986 --> 00:02:38.986
"But maybe I don't need to."

43
00:02:38.987 --> 00:02:41.729
The cowboy looked around.

44
00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:45.048
A crowd of people stood near the big bear statue.

45
00:02:45.049 --> 00:02:48.650
They were buying pretzels at a pretzel stand.

46
00:02:48.651 --> 00:02:53.288
Stinky Bart tossed the lasso. "Yee-ha!"

47
00:02:53.289 --> 00:02:56.549
The lasso looped around the bear statue's head.

48
00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.672
Stinky Bart pulled.

49
00:02:58.673 --> 00:03:01.836
The bear began to fall toward the crowd.

50
00:03:01.837 --> 00:03:03.826
Everyone screamed.

51
00:03:03.827 --> 00:03:07.300
"Save us, Rocket Girl!" cried the pretzel man.

52
00:03:07.301 --> 00:03:10.177
Roxy flew fast.

53
00:03:10.178 --> 00:03:14.611
She caught the bear statue just before it hit the crowd.

54
00:03:14.612 --> 00:03:18.348
She didn't notice the lasso slip off.

55
00:03:18.349 --> 00:03:22.075
Everyone cheered as Roxy stood the statue back up.

56
00:03:22.076 --> 00:03:26.299
"Thank you!" said the pretzel man.

57
00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:31.599
Roxy smiled. "No problem, folks. I—aah!"

58
00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.611
Roxy felt the lasso loop around her.

59
00:03:34.612 --> 00:03:44.233
"Yee-ha!" cried Stinky Bart. "I got you now!"
